    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438550/extras/4723814fefc2e6a1cff455a61f6a7958.avif?t=1739822024\" data-has-big width=800 height=224 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dive into a chaotic, fear-fueled multiplayer brawl for 2-8 players, where you\u2019ll outwit, scare, and eliminate your friends using their deepest, darkest fears \u2014 all while they\u2019re plotting to do the same to you!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Designed to spark late-night chaos between friends, this game truly shines when played with your entire friend group. The more players, the wilder the gameplay experience! Prefer a bigger challenge? Jump into public lobbies and face off against strangers too!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>This indie multiplayer game is a passion project, developed entirely by just one person</i>.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Objective</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Win</strong> by having the most kills at the end of the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect</strong> <i>bloodbones</i> to call upon Fobias to torment your friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hide</strong> in the shadows concealing your location to other players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize</strong> your character with a wide variety of options</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438550/extras/7ffb5b648011adae5a2b71342ba25da2.avif?t=1739822024\" data-has-big width=800 height=224 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Customization</strong> \u2013 Choose your character, mix and match outfits, and arm yourself with unique weapons to express your style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Customization</strong> \u2013 Host public or private lobbies and tweak game rules to suit your playstyle. Fast-paced chaos or sneaky tactics? You decide!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Public &amp; Private Matches</strong> \u2013 Play with friends in private lobbies or jump into public games to challenge players worldwide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use Their Fears Against Them</strong> \u2013 Outsmart and scare your opponents by exploiting their worst fears. Hunt or be hunted!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaotic Fun Every Match</strong> \u2013 No two games are the same! Adapt, strategize, and cause mayhem in every round.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick &amp; Easy Matchmaking</strong> \u2013 Seamless lobby creation and fast matchmaking keep the chaos going all night long!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438550/extras/4723814fefc2e6a1cff455a61f6a7958.avif?t=1739822024\" data-has-big width=800 height=224 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dive into a chaotic, fear-fueled multiplayer brawl for 2-8 players, where you\u2019ll outwit, scare, and eliminate your friends using their deepest, darkest fears \u2014 all while they\u2019re plotting to do the same to you!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Designed to spark late-night chaos between friends, this game truly shines when played with your entire friend group. The more players, the wilder the gameplay experience! Prefer a bigger challenge? Jump into public lobbies and face off against strangers too!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>This indie multiplayer game is a passion project, developed entirely by just one person</i>.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Objective</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Win</strong> by having the most kills at the end of the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect</strong> <i>bloodbones</i> to call upon Fobias to torment your friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hide</strong> in the shadows concealing your location to other players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize</strong> your character with a wide variety of options</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438550/extras/7ffb5b648011adae5a2b71342ba25da2.avif?t=1739822024\" data-has-big width=800 height=224 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Customization</strong> \u2013 Choose your character, mix and match outfits, and arm yourself with unique weapons to express your style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Customization</strong> \u2013 Host public or private lobbies and tweak game rules to suit your playstyle. Fast-paced chaos or sneaky tactics? You decide!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Public &amp; Private Matches</strong> \u2013 Play with friends in private lobbies or jump into public games to challenge players worldwide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use Their Fears Against Them</strong> \u2013 Outsmart and scare your opponents by exploiting their worst fears. Hunt or be hunted!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaotic Fun Every Match</strong> \u2013 No two games are the same! Adapt, strategize, and cause mayhem in every round.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick &amp; Easy Matchmaking</strong> \u2013 Seamless lobby creation and fast matchmaking keep the chaos going all night long!</p></li></ul>",
